## Summary
The Câmara de Mortágua is advancing with the rehabilitation of the ETAR, described as the largest intervention in the municipality's wastewater treatment system. This project aims to enhance local wastewater infrastructure, as highlighted by the autarquia.

## Key Points
- The Câmara de Mortágua is undertaking a major rehabilitation project for the ETAR.
- The ETAR is a wastewater treatment plant critical to the local system.
- This intervention is the largest to be carried out in the municipality's wastewater treatment infrastructure.


